# 8. Separate Schema Version from Documentation Version

Do not assume that the database schema version and documentation version are the same.

Display them separately.

Example:

```text
Database Schema: v4.7
Documentation: v3.2
Status: Documentation is behind schema
```

This is important because the SQL schema may change without the documentation being updated.

The system should detect this condition automatically.

