# 10. Immutable Published Versions

Use the following model:

```text
Working Copy
      ↓
Review
      ↓
Save Version
      ↓
Published Version
```

Once a version is published, it should be treated as immutable.

If the user wants to change it:

```text
Published v2.3
      ↓
Create Working Copy
      ↓
Modify
      ↓
Review
      ↓
Publish v2.4
```

Never silently modify an already published version.

